    {
      "id": "mma-mma-pi-note-admission-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6694,
      "y": 897.45,
      "width": 392,
      "height": 170.10000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "mma-section-4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 233630468,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793894400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "sourceShapeId": "shape:mma-pi-note-admission",
        "section": 4
      },
      "text": "资源准入（默认）\n\n运行 2 / 搜索 1 / 媒体 2。\n供应商请求并发按供应商共享。\n目录与索引读取给常规请求有限优先等待。\n单个数据目录只允许一个宿主持锁。\nPi token / trusted identity 独立校验。",
      "originalText": "资源准入（默认）\n\n运行 2 / 搜索 1 / 媒体 2。\n供应商请求并发按供应商共享。\n目录与索引读取给常规请求有限优先等待。\n单个数据目录只允许一个宿主持锁。\nPi token / trusted identity 独立校验。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mma-mma-pi-note-admission",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "mma-mma-pi-note-independent-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5654,
      "y": 1444.2,
      "width": 392,
      "height": 291.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "mma-section-4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 23690045,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793894400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "sourceShapeId": "shape:mma-pi-note-independent",
        "section": 4
      },
      "text": "独立于常规链路\n\nPi 的 KnowledgeGateway 直接访问索引。\nsearch 使用精确匹配，或 Dense 与词面融合。\n不复用常规 RetrievalService 的画像路由、RRF\n/ Cross-Encoder 编排，也未接入原生 CLIP /\nCLAP 搜索。\n\n媒体观察、Embedding 使用 Pi 的\nModelTransport；主模型、观察模型与配置按运\n行确定。\nDecision 常规开关不控制 Pi。",
      "originalText": "独立于常规链路\n\nPi 的 KnowledgeGateway 直接访问索引。\nsearch 使用精确匹配，或 Dense 与词面融合。\n不复用常规 RetrievalService 的画像路由、RRF / Cross-Encoder 编排，也未接入原生 CLIP / CLAP 搜索。\n\n媒体观察、Embedding 使用 Pi 的 ModelTransport；主模型、观察模型与配置按运行确定。\nDecision 常规开关不控制 Pi。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mma-mma-pi-note-independent",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
