      "text": "结束与恢复语义\n\n正常交付：completed / partial。\n澄清：needs_input。\n用户停止：cancelling → cancelled。\n异常：failed，保留证据与回执。\n宿主重启：未完任务 failed /\ncancelled，code=host_restarted；不自动重放\n付费请求。",
      "originalText": "结束与恢复语义\n\n正常交付：completed / partial。\n澄清：needs_input。\n用户停止：cancelling → cancelled。\n异常：failed，保留证据与回执。\n宿主重启：未完任务 failed / cancelled，code=host_restarted；不自动重放付费请求。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "mma-mma-pi-note-exit",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
